    {
      "timestamp": "2026-08-30T22:26:23.044439+00:00",
      "type": "understanding",
      "summary": "Agent explained goal and mechanics.",
      "understanding": {
        "goal_understanding": "Navigate the grid to complete every goal cell in each level. A goal is completed by stepping onto its cell only when the carried piece exactly matches that goal\u2019s required shape, color, and rotation; completing all goals advances to the next level, and finishing all levels wins.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move costs 1 stamina; when stamina reaches 0 you lose a life and stamina resets to max, and losing all lives ends the game. Movement is constrained by walls, and the state provides blocked_directions that must never be chosen because they waste a turn with no movement. Stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece: shape changers cycle shapes 0\u20135, color changers cycle orange\u2192blue\u2192green\u2192red\u2192orange, and rotation changers rotate 90\u00b0 clockwise (0\u219290\u2192180\u2192270\u21920). A goal cell becomes activated only when shape, color, and rotation all match simultaneously; then stepping onto it completes that goal."
      }
    }
